        skos:definition        "A company that manufactures and supplies GPS-aided inertial measurements units (IMU), attitude and heading reference systems (AHRS), vertical gyroscopes and inclinometer/tilt sensors. The company was derived from Crossbow Technologies after it was acquired by Moog Inc. in 2011."@en;
