        skos:definition        "Bellamare LLC is an engineering company that designs subsea instruments for the oceanographic, offshore, and aquaculture industries. They design underwater tools for subsea monitoring and intervention, and help marine scientists achieve their research goals by providing custom designed field and laboratory equipment, tailored to client specific demands."@en;
