        skos:definition        "Consilium Middle East is a subsidiary company of Consilium Marine AB, Sweden, established in 2000. It primarily develops products and systems for the Oil and Gas and Marine industries. Consilium also produces fire detection equipment for transport (e.g. trains) and high-value buildings such as hospitals, airports and museums."@en;
