        skos:altLabel          "HOBI Labs";
        skos:definition        "A US-based company specialised in sponsored research and instrument manufacturing. HOBI Labs' main products include spectral optical backscattering, fluorescence and attenuation sensors designed for natural water measurements, as well as hyperspectral radiometers. HOBI Labs was founded in 1997 and ceased operations in 2014; since then, a separate company called Hobi Instrument Services has been providing calibration, repair and limited sales of HOBI Labs instruments."@en;
