        skos:definition        "Metek Meteorologische Messtechnik, Germany, offers a wide range of high-end meteorological instrumentation starting with a family of sonic anemometers and variants of versatile data loggers. Ground based remote sensing techniques provide profiles of wind, temperature, rain rate and cloud droplets in continuous unattended operation. The company was founded in 1989."@en;
