        owl:versionInfo        "1";
        skos:altLabel          "SERCEL";
        skos:definition        "A company that designs and manufactures high-tech solutions for subsurface exploration, structural monitoring, defence and underwater acoustics applications. Founded in 1956 under the name SMEG, Sercel took on its current name in 1962. Headquartered in Nantes (France), Sercel operates worldwide and employs more than 1500 people."@en;
