        skos:definition        "A British manufacturing company founded in 1990 that specialises in the measurement of oceanographic and process parameters including temperature, depth, turbidity, suspended sediment, motion, orientation, cathodic protection, subsea leaks and marine mammal activity, as well as through and above water data communication systems. Other areas of expertise include consultancy, systems integration and real time monitoring systems. The company is headquartered in Basingstoke."@en;
