        skos:definition        "QIAGEN (formerly Diagen) offer molecular testing solutions, from DNA, RNA, and protein extraction from biological samples, to testing technologies targeting single or multiple molecular variants, and software to analyse and interpret molecular data to deliver valuable insights. With headquarters in Dusseldorf, Germany it was founded in 1984."@en;
