        skos:definition        "A family business based in Tiefgraben, Austria, specialised in the manufacture and distribution of sediment and water sampling equipment. The company was started by Richard Niederreiter in 1991, and taken over by his sons Daniel and Martin Niederreiter in 2020."@en;
        skos:notation          "SDN:L35::MAN0271";
