        skos:definition        "A designer and manufacturer of remote ultra-low power dataloggers and data collection platforms for the acquisition and transmission of data and images, compatible with many sensors for the measurement of all types of meteorological, hydrological, physical and environmental parameters. Founded in 1974."@en;
