        skos:definition        "A manufactuer of dynamic pressure, force, torque and acceleration technology for industry and scientific research. Their headquarters are based in Switzerland, but have other locations globally. Founded in the 1960s."@en;
        skos:notation          "SDN:L35::MAN0142";
