        owl:versionInfo        "1";
        skos:altLabel          "Hydro-Bios";
        skos:definition        "A German based developer and manufacturer of mechanical samplers for limnology and oceanography. Founded in 1927 as 'Walter Schweder Precision Engineering', the company became 'HYDRO-BIOS Apparatebau GmbH' in 1960. In 1963, Hans Fischer joined the company and the company re-located to Kiel-Altenholz."@en;
        skos:notation          "SDN:L35::MAN0198";
        skos:note              "accepted"@en;
