        skos:altLabel          "HEITRONICS";
        skos:definition        "A company that develops, manufactures and distributes industry-specific systems and solutions for contactless temperature measurement (infrared radiation thermometers) with long-term stability of temperatures ranging from -100 to 3000 degrees Celsius. The product range is complemented by display and networking devices, accessories for mounting, adapting and protecting the instruments, calibration certification as well as configuration and evaluation software. Founded in 1995."@en;
        skos:notation          "SDN:L35::MAN0107";
