        skos:definition        "Imenco AS is a Norwegian company based in Aksdal, founded in 1979 as an engineering company. Imenco is a group of companies working mainly in five business areas: offshore oil and gas, offshore renewables, aquaculture, marine and naval, and industrial. The company specialises in mechanical, hydraulic and electrical engineering, in particular subsea and surface camera, light, laser, and electronic technologies."@en;
