        skos:altLabel          "SIMRAD_YACHT";
        skos:definition        "A subsidiary of the Navico group that specialises in that specialises in navigation products for marine vessels. It was established in 1946. In 2008 the company absorbed MX Marine - acquired as a result of the takeover by Navico of the marine electronics division of Brunswick New Technologies Inc in 2007."@en;
        skos:notation          "SDN:L35::MAN0122";
        skos:note              "accepted"@en;
